a mixed bag of Commissions at you, and each time you complete them dutifully. So thank you for that.","nextNodeIds":[221100306]},{"nodeId":221100306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":764103824,"text":"Unseen Razor, where are you hiding...","nextNodeIds":[221100307,221100308]},{"nodeId":221100307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":920337816,"text":"You'll find it eventually.","nextNodeIds":[221100309]},{"nodeId":221100309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":2954405128,"text":"...Are you trying to make me feel better? Thanks, but this is barely a minor setback.","nextNodeIds":[221100310]},{"nodeId":221100310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":860836344,"text":"No matter how long it takes, and where this search takes me... I will find that sword.","nextNodeIds":[221100311]},{"nodeId":221100311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":3009196688,"text":"I plan to keep widening the search area, so I may well call for your help again in future — and yes, I will continue to pay you for your services.","nextNodeIds":[221100316]},{"nodeId":221100316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":4181208776,"text":"Here is your payment. I should go, there is a new list of Commissions waiting for me to vet.","nextNodeIds":[221100317]},{"nodeId":221100317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":1293401336,"text":"Unseen Razor... You won't stay unseen forever...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":221100308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1318504656,"text":"These Commissions don't seem sword-related at all.","nextNodeIds":[221100312]},{"nodeId":221100312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":2595049256,"text":"That is because I already took on every single Commission that had anything at all to do with a sword. Sadly, they led me nowhere.","nextNodeIds":[221100313]},{"nodeId":221100313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":166272240,"text":"So then I thought... Surely, whatever happened to separate my brother from his sword, it can only have been under highly dangerous circumstances.","nextNodeIds":[221100314]},{"nodeId":221100314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":1802666952,"text":"So I started accepting other Commissions — ones I thought just might be dangerous enough to give me a lead on the whereabouts of Unseen Razor.","nextNodeIds":[221100315]},{"nodeId":221100315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"Lan","textMapHash":1052081344,"text":"However, there are slightly too many dangerous Commissions for me to handle on my own. That is why I started asking you to help.","nextNodeIds":[221100316]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LUA_NOTIFY","PPFLKMOMKAI":"13310431301"}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["Event_25002_01","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":2211003,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Report back to Lan","stepDescTextMapHash":2913022750,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2211003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NON